# Cold boot through the language menu and the data-disk prompt to the first game screen,
# sprites off, one shot. Colour counts: docs/format.md, "Screens".
until colours 16
wait 50
click
until colours 4
wait 20
key 1
# The data-disk prompt prints a character at a time; a key before it finishes is ignored.
wait 400
disk df0 disk2
wait 20
key space
until colours 18 6000
wait 100
sprites off
wait 2
shot earth-base-nosprite
quit
